
JameGameGameJam

Hi! This is a little game I made for a game jam. It's small, quiet and a bit messy, and I'm really happy with it.

You play as a tiny character in a cozy room with a couch, a fridge, a speaker and a TV. Walk around, jump on things, and get close to stuff to find out what your character is thinking. Some thoughts are about the music, some are about being hungry, and some are just about how nice it is to sit down.

This is my first time making a game, so please be kind to it. :)

How to play

When the game opens you'll see a menu. Press E to start.

U play with WASD

Not mine: I added Sans. song, i think is the most chill song in the world.
